CODE REVIEW

Darwin canonicalization:
  _canonicalize_darwin_existing_path opens the already-resolved existing path
  with O_EVTONLY/O_CLOEXEC/O_NOFOLLOW, obtains the kernel-stored spelling with
  F_GETPATH, rejects empty or non-absolute results, and verifies the returned
  path still names the same object. It performs no parent-directory scan.

Total deadline:
  _ExclusiveFileLock.__enter__ establishes deadline before
  _prepare_for_acquire. It checks deadline exhaustion after preparation and
  after lock-directory creation; the retry sleep is capped by remaining time.
  Preparation expiry occurs before process reservation, while later failures
  retain the existing reservation cleanup path.

Deterministic interleaving:
  test_concurrent_home_preparation_avoids_canonicalization_stampede constructs
  twelve same-home locks, synchronizes all preparation calls at a barrier,
  rejects every pre-lock parent scan, and proves all consumers finish.

Normative fit:
  /Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/curator-spec/profiles/manager.md sections
  2.5-2.6 require canonical ordered project locks, build-before-home ordering,
  one manager-home mutation lock, deterministic consumer-last commit, reverse
  rollback, and recovery under the home lock. The reviewed rework preserves
  those already accepted boundaries.

